This repository assesses and partially derives schema files from Open Source Point of Sale (OSPOS):

  https://github.com/opensourcepos/opensourcepos
  tag 3.3.9, commit c00ff28d10f25c2638a65cbfbbcd08b75a83c59f
  MIT License, copyright (c) 2013-2025 jekkos and contributors (see that project's own LICENSE file for
  the full list of copyright holders).

`schema/ospos-3.3.9.mysql.sql` and `schema/ospos-3.3.9.reference-data.sql` in this repository are
derived from that project's `database/tables.sql` and `database/constraints.sql` (table definitions and
the application's own default reference rows, with secret-looking empty settings columns removed; no
customer, employee or sale data, since the upstream project ships none). `docs/assessment.md` quotes
short code fragments and cites file paths from that project's source under the same licence.

No other source code from opensourcepos/opensourcepos is vendored into this repository. The rest of this
repository (the tillcarry migration tool, its tests, the assessment prose, and the seeded invented data)
is original work, licensed under this repository's own MIT LICENSE.
